// The `*_deadline` entry points and the cancel/drain machinery they need
// (#2291, #3590) were moved verbatim into the sibling `tcpdeadline.bit`.
// This file was 794 lines against the hard 800-line E0200 ceiling. Same
// module, same imports, no resolution change.
